<title>USA: AMEX to list options on HA-LO Industries Nov. 29.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list options on HA-LO Industries Nov. 29.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amercian Stock Exchange announced Friday it will list options on HA-LO Industries beginning Friday, November 29.</p>
<p>The option will open with strike prices of 30, 35, and 40 with initial expiration months of December 1996 and January, March and June 1997.</p>
<p>Susquehanna Investment Group will be specialist.</p>
<p>--Chicago Derivatives Desk</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters,com</p>
